      {
        "text": "#Local Data\n\n**Local data** is data that is stored directly on the device that is running the application. \nIt is available immediately and does not require internet connection.\n\n---\n**Example**: A variable in your code, a saved game file on your hard drive, or photos stored on your phone.",
